ing Light】Gently touch the top of the speaker to change the light color and light on/off, four modes of light give you the perfect gaming atmosphere."]}, "B0HFHJXD7Q": {"rating": 4.9, "reviews": 49, "bullets": ["[Enhanced Viewing Experience] This portable laptop monitor features a durable and sturdy casing and a matching stand. This upgraded extended monitor also offers a higher-quality smooth feeling, and is", "[More Comfort & Space-Saving] Unlike most extended monitor for laptop on the market, this CIDETTY 15.6\" second monitor for laptop features a unique vertical stacked screen design. This space-saving de", "[All in One Easy Adjustment Software]: Install The Extra Smart Display Software lets you easily adjust brightness, contrast, color temperature, and activate Eye Care Mode, Game Mode, or Split Screen M", "[Dual Screen, Double Productivity] This Portable monitor for laptop supports expand mode, mirror mode, and second screen mode, perfectly fits conference presentations, multitasking, and allows you to ", "[Plug & Play, no driver required]: If your laptop has one full-functioned Type-C port, you can use one USB-C to USB-C cable to connect the product to your laptop. If your laptop has one USB-A or USB-C"]}, "B0GZ2MFZNH": {"rating": 4.5, "reviews": 5675, "bullets": ["Stairs and Room Entrances for Daily Access: Fits openings 29.6 to 39.1 inches wide; this 28 inch tall baby gate for stairs has a 22.63 inch walk-through door for easier access at stairways, room entra", "Double-Lock Design for Controlled Access: InnoTruth metal baby gate with a double-lock release helps keep little hands from opening it easily; one-hand access lets adults pass through while holding a ", "Auto-Close Door for Everyday Convenience: This auto-close baby gate swings inward or outward to match home layouts; it closes when released and stays open at 90 degrees or wider for easier access duri", "Ramp and Y-Bolts for Flexible Use: Bottom ramp helps strollers roll through the walk-through d